      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Two-way Sync",
      "items": [
        "The Sync Service pulls data from both the local database and the remote Google Sheet.",
        "It diffs the data based on cell hashes to identify changes on both sides."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Atomic Updates",
      "items": [
        "Local changes (e.g. from the admin panel) are pushed up.",
